  "title": "Employee Benefit Exceptions — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PersonnelAdministration.EmployeeBenefitException",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>Overrides the employee's own ticket or health reimbursement entitlement for a period.</p><p>For health reimbursement, the amount replaces the employee's share from their sub group's entitlement. For tickets, the time engine uses the amount when accruing the employee's own ticket; an amount of zero means not entitled.</p>",
